%R	7000	5004	1	Unforeseen underground obstruction (redundant sewer pipe, not on services plan) hit at CH12-18m during secant piling, South wall. Piling rig stood down 4 days for potholing/removal, 2 days re-sequencing. Client PM notified 03-Jun, photos on site diary. Potential EOT claim - services survey was principal-supplied.
%R	7001	5008	1	Groundwater inflow exceeded design assumption during Stage 2 bulk excavation - dewatering wells under-capacity for actual permeability encountered. Additional wellpoint system mobilised, 4 day delay to excavation face advance. Geotech advised on 08-Jun, no design change required, dewatering rate increased.
%R	7002	5013	1	TBM assembly delayed - cutterhead bearing shipment held at customs (supplier logistics issue), original ETA 02-Jun now 10-Jun. Supplier confirms not a manufacturing defect. Assembly crew partially remobilised to support station box MEP first fix in interim to reduce idle cost.
